cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite this repository (and the KBS
  manuscript once a DOI is assigned).
type: software
title: "DH2A-KT: Leakage-Audited Knowledge Attribution for Knowledge Tracing"
abstract: >-
  Companion code for DH2A-KT. The pipeline constructs train-only auxiliary
  knowledge, audits hyperedge leakage, and credits only messages that
  survive a matched-twin operating rule. It is not a new hypergraph
  predictor. Pairwise train-only graph construction is reused from the
  companion P0 protocol (edu-risk-lab/leakage-controlled-kt-audit, pin
  5e3d6a0).
